# Programming conventions

Follow `agents/docs/programming.md`. Hub: `AGENTS.md`.

- Static `import` only -- no `require`, no dynamic imports (Rollup)
- Do not commit or push until the user asks
- Prefer `npx flow`; fix Flow errors before finishing new code. Save `flow check` as indented JSON at `/tmp/flow-check-now.json`
- Run tests yourself when relevant (`jest ... --no-watch`); never hard-code Jest workarounds
